### Variáveis
@base = http://localhost:3000/api
@adminEmail = admin@helpdesk.dev
@adminSenha = admin12345
@token = cole-o-token-do-login-aqui

### Health check (público)
GET {{base}}/health

### Login do administrador
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminSenha}}"
}

### Quem sou eu
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lista de chamados com filtros e paginação
GET {{base}}/tickets?status=open&priority=high&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalhe de um chamado
GET {{base}}/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Abre um chamado
POST {{base}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Erro ao abrir o ERP",
  "description": "A tela de login do ERP retorna erro 500 desde a atualização de hoje.",
  "priority": "high",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Assume o chamado e inicia o atendimento
PATCH {{base}}/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assigneeId": 2,
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### Comentário público
POST {{base}}/tickets/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Estamos verificando a sincronização da conta."
}

### Nota interna (somente equipe)
POST {{base}}/tickets/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Checklist interno: confirmar o alias correto antes de resetar.",
  "internal": true
}

### Painel de indicadores (equipe)
GET {{base}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Categorias
GET {{base}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nova categoria (admin)
POST {{base}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Telefonia",
  "color": "#10b981"
}

### Equipe (admin vê todos; agente vê apenas a equipe)
GET {{base}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Promove uma conta a agente (admin)
PATCH {{base}}/users/4/role
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "agent"
}
